Adapted files
-------------
  src/tools/fileLock.ts        adapted from crates/jcode-app-core/src/tool/file_lock.rs
                               (per-path async mutex for file-editing tools).
  src/agent/kvCacheMonitor.ts  adapted from src/kv_cache_monitor.rs
                               (prompt-cache hit/miss accounting per provider).
  src/server/sharedCodeSession.ts
                               adapted from ref/jcode_daemon_bench.py and
                               ref/SESSION_HIBERNATION.md (one long-lived agent server
                               hosting N concurrent sessions over a control socket).
  bench/fakeModel.ts           adapted from ref/fake_model.py (scripted offline model
                               used by the memory benchmarks).
  bench/memBench.ts            adapted from ref/jcode_daemon_bench.py and
                               ref/bench_memory_cli.py (process-tree memory harness).
  bench/rssSampler.ts          adapted from ref/bench_memory_cli.py (process-tree PSS
                               summing).
  bench/perProcess.ts          adapted from ref/bench_memory_cli.py (per-session tool
                               spawn).
  bench/launchers.ts           adapted from ref/jcode_daemon_bench.py (shared daemon
                               control socket).
